# Citation metadata for this modified wien2wannier (version 3.0).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this version of wien2wannier, please cite the original
  wien2wannier paper listed under references, which every use of
  wien2wannier must cite, together with the paper given under
  preferred-citation and the archived release.
title: "wien2wannier 3.0: hybrid pre-Wannierization for WIEN2k"
type: software
version: "3.0"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23485188
repository-code: "https://github.com/wcomaskey/wien2wannier"
abstract: >-
  A modified version of wien2wannier (upstream 2.0), the interface between
  WIEN2k and Wannier90. Version 3.0 adds a hybrid pre-Wannierization, which
  freezes every Bloch state below an energy ceiling derived from the number
  of Wannier functions, minimizes the gauge-invariant spread with the frozen
  states held fixed, builds an SCDM gauge and writes Wannier90 input for an
  isolated set of bands. A second route writes the same selection as
  Wannier90 disentanglement windows.
